Original debugger implementation for this project. Copyright 2026.
Source is supplied for evaluation and integration in this project.
No third-party runtime/parser source is copied into this module.

The generated C/C++ fixtures link the separate, pinned compiler module's libc,
libc++ and compiler runtime. Their upstream attribution and unresolved binary
provenance are recorded in compiler/resources/LICENSES.md on module/02-compiler.
This file does not grant licenses for those third-party libraries. This prototype
is not approved for public distribution; complete those notices before release.
